# A phone on its charger (issue 088): a small prop on the nightstand, drawn over `nightstand` and offered as the place of "Charge your phone". The phone lies screen-up (ink body, slate screen, a butter glint) with a paper cable running east to a plug. 16x16 cell; the prop sits at nightstand x 18, y 0, so the phone is on the free middle of the top.
size: 16x16
